    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, ive got a massive headache right now. it kinda hit me out of nowhere, like really fast, and i feel a bit sick to my stomach. i get bad migraines pretty often so i'm thinking it's just another one... should i just take my sumatriptan now or wait a bit?",
