      "content": "it's not helping much. i'm starting to feel a bit dizzy and my neck feels really stiff too, which happens sometimes with my migraines but it's a lot more intense this time. i really don't want to deal with the hospital wait and the cost if i can just get this under control at home. if i take the sumatriptan with a couple of ibuprofen it should be fine right? i just need to sleep this off.",
